% permanent-income growth's; before that script G, a script g that no font has, and Roman G and g.
\ARKcommand{\PtyGroFac}{\mathrm{G}}   % growth of labor-augmenting productivity Z (\PtyLab), itself a normalizer and so never bold (owner ruling 2026-11-16);
